Z||000000||Tina||09-23-2001||11:52 PM||||Just wondering, which manual models ever came with it?<BR>Until this afternoon, I thought only automatic's came with it.<BR>But apperantly these cruise modded manuals are out there. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>So was this factory,... an option on all manuals,...or just the 2.8's?<P>Just a bit confused here.<BR>(Got 4 manual Fiero's here,<BR>but not one has cruise control.<P>Tina<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||Posthumane||09-23-2001||11:53 PM||||Mine's an 84 SE 4spd (4cyl) and I have cruise control. I think it was an option on all models.||||reg||1
