Z||000005||SLYGUY||09-24-2001||01:15 AM||||Both of my fieros had it. <P>My 86 SE V6 had it.<BR>My 88 GT has it.<P>Figured it was an option, but I've never seen a fiero without it. <P>I'd trade my cruise for the sub speaker system that was in my 86 though.<P>Sly||||reg||1
