Z||000009||SLYGUY||09-24-2001||01:56 PM||||I tried it on the way home from Hermosa Beach where I bought the car. Didn't work then. Before I put a lot of investigation work into finding the electrical/vacuum culprit I checked the clutch pedal cruise cancel switch. <BR>Laid in the drivers footwell. Adjusted the switch and turned the key. Flipped the cruise switch on and heard no relay. Adjusted some more and heard the relay. <BR>Cruise worked great after that.<P>Just my $.02<P>Sly||||reg||1
